B.Mm=new A.a("Com Scobey ou Manning a perda nos tubos n\xe3o envelhece aqui (s\xf3 o C de Hazen-Williams e a rugosidade de Darcy-Weisbach); o entupimento vale.","With Scobey or Manning the pipe losses do not age here (only the Hazen-Williams C and the Darcy-Weisbach roughness do); the clogging applies.","Con Scobey o Manning la p\xe9rdida en las tuber\xedas no envejece aqu\xed (solo la C de Hazen-Williams y la rugosidad de Darcy-Weisbach); la obstrucci\xf3n vale.")
