B.amk=new A.a("Endere\xe7o http:// bloqueado: o navegador n\xe3o carrega blocos sem HTTPS numa p\xe1gina HTTPS (s\xf3 http://localhost funciona). Use o endere\xe7o https:// do servidor.","http:// address blocked: the browser loads no tiles without HTTPS on an HTTPS page (only http://localhost works). Use the server's https:// address.","Direcci\xf3n http:// bloqueada: el navegador no carga teselas sin HTTPS en una p\xe1gina HTTPS (solo http://localhost funciona). Use la direcci\xf3n https:// del servidor.")
