B.yR=new A.a("As laterais s\xe3o calculadas emissor a emissor (rede resolvida n\xf3 a n\xf3, sem fator de Christiansen); a varia\xe7\xe3o de press\xe3o do setor fica na janela de cada emissor; os tubos s\xe3o dimensionados pelo menor custo de capital mais energia dentro das velocidades e da classe de press\xe3o.","The laterals are calculated emitter by emitter (the network solved node by node, no Christiansen factor); the pressure variation of a zone stays within the window of each emitter; the pipes are sized by the least capital plus energy cost within the velocities and the pressure class.","Los laterales se calculan emisor a emisor (red resuelta nodo a nodo, sin factor de Christiansen); la variaci\xf3n de presi\xf3n del sector queda en la ventana de cada emisor; las tuber\xedas se dimensionan por el menor costo de capital m\xe1s energ\xeda dentro de las velocidades y de la clase de presi\xf3n.")
