B.apX=new A.a("BRASIL. Lei n\xba 9.433, de 8 de janeiro de 1997 (Pol\xedtica Nacional de Recursos H\xeddricos); ANA, Resolu\xe7\xe3o n\xba 1.939/2017 e Resolu\xe7\xe3o n\xba 188/2024.","BRAZIL. Law 9.433 of 8 January 1997 (National Water Resources Policy); ANA, Resolution 1.939/2017 and Resolution 188/2024.","BRASIL. Ley 9.433, de 8 de enero de 1997 (Pol\xedtica Nacional de Recursos H\xeddricos); ANA, Resoluci\xf3n 1.939/2017 y Resoluci\xf3n 188/2024.")
